-- Smash history: majors from before start.gg (2003 to 2016), from Liquipedia (Matthew, 2026-11-17: "Use
-- liquipedia to archive smash history" / "do as much as you can"). Read by hand in Matthew's Chrome, one
-- list page per game (Liquipedia's "Major Tournaments" lists for Melee, Wii U, Brawl, Project M and 64),
-- a few seconds apart: no automated reading of Liquipedia. Facts only: name, dates, city, entrants, and
-- each game's winner and runner-up (Liquipedia's lists give those two). Each major credits its Liquipedia
-- list page as the source (CC-BY-SA). Project M is filed under P+ (Matthew's choice). Added as majors
-- "added by hand" (source 'manual'), like the admin form; safe to run twice (existing slugs are skipped).

insert into public.majors (slug, name, start_at, end_at, games, entrants, city, country, source_url, source, results_saved_at, live_notified_at)
